{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53899","headline":"赠舍弟 · 杨宇","name":"赠舍弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦云蜀浪两堪愁，尔养晨昏我远游。\n千里客心难寄梦，两行乡泪爲君流。\n早驱风雨知龙圣，饿食鱼虾觉虎羞。\n袖里镆鋣光似水，丈夫不合等闲休。\n（《才调集》卷九）（按：《全唐诗》卷五六四误收此诗於宇兄牢名下，今爲改正重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨宇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}